The following functions are exported by
.Pa bin/browse.mjs ,
located in
.Nm jg Ap s
installation directory.
.
.SS Locating browsers
.FUNCTION -async find "browser \*= \(dqauto\(dq" "unstable \*= \*[false]"
Locate the specified browser on the host system.
.RV Promise ?String
.PARAMETERS
.PARAM String browser \(dqauto\(dq
Name of the desired browser;
.Sy auto
will locate whatever's available.
.PARAM Boolean unstable \*[false]
Check for unstable versions first.
.
.FUNCTION -async findChrome "unstable \*= \*[false]"
Locate Google Chrome on the host system.
.RV Promise ?String
.PARAMETERS
.PARAM Boolean unstable \*[false]
Check for unstable Chrome versions first.
.
.FUNCTION -async findEdge
Locate Microsoft Edge on the host system.
.RV Promise ?String
.
.FUNCTION -async findFirefox "unstable \*= \*[false]"
Locate Firefox on the host system.
Influenced by the
.Ev FIREFOX_NIGHTLY_BIN ,
.Ev FIREFOX_BIN ,
.Ev FIREFOX_DEVELOPER_BIN ,
and
.Ev FIREFOX_AURORA_BIN
environment variables.
.RV Promise ?String
.PARAMETERS
.PARAM Boolean unstable \*[false]
Check for unstable Firefox versions first.
.
.FUNCTION -async findIE
Locate Internet Explorer on the host system.
.Pq Bless your heart if you find yourself needing this function .
.RV Promise ?String
.
.FUNCTION -async findOpera
Locate Opera on the host system.
Influenced by the
.Ev OPERA_BIN
environment variable,
if set.
.RV Promise ?String
.
.FUNCTION -async findSafari
Locate Safari on the host system.
Influenced by the
.Ev SAFARI_BIN
environment variable,
if set.
.RV Promise ?String
.
.SS Opening browsers
.FUNCTION -async open "url" "browser \*= \(dqauto\(dq"
Open a page in the specified browser.
.Pp
If the second parameter is
.Qq Li auto ,
the first available browser is used.
.RV Promise ChildProcess
.PARAMETERS
.PARAM String | URL url
.PARAM String browser "\(dqauto\(dq"
.
.FUNCTION -async openChrome "url"
Open a page in Google Chrome.
.RV Promise ChildProcess
.PARAMETERS
.PARAM String | URL url
.
.FUNCTION -async openEdge "url"
Open a page in Microsoft Edge.
.RV Promise ChildProcess
.PARAMETERS
.PARAM String | URL url
.
.FUNCTION -async openFirefox "url"
Open a page in Firefox.
Uses the
.Pa etc/profiles/firefox-headless.js
profile to configure the process.
.RV Promise ChildProcess
.PARAMETERS
.PARAM String | URL url
.
.FUNCTION -async openIE "url"
Open a page in Internet Explorer.
.RV Promise ChildProcess
.PARAMETERS
.PARAM String | URL url
.
.FUNCTION -async openOpera "url"
Open a page in Opera.
.RV Promise ChildProcess
.PARAMETERS
.PARAM String | URL url
.
.FUNCTION -async openSafari "url"
Open a page in Safari.
.RV Promise ChildProcess
.PARAMETERS
.PARAM String | URL url
.
.SS Other functions
.FUNCTION getWin32ProgramPaths
Resolve a list of program directories for each drive in the user's
.Ev $Path
.Aq Lk \fIhttps://ss64.com/nt/syntax-variables.html\fP .
Only relevant on Windows.
.RV Array String
.
.FUNCTION -async getVersion "path"
Retrieve a program's version string.
.RV Promise ?String
.PARAMETERS
.PARAM String path
.
.
